{
 "name": "AgentKit · 01 — Telegram AI Assistant",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "87c7a7bc-9c7c-4cba-b518-daceac21fcb1",
   "name": "📌 SETUP GUIDE",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    180,
    60
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "color": 4,
    "content": "## 🤖 AgentKit · 01 — Telegram AI Assistant\n**Apna personal AI assistant — Telegram pe, poori chat memory ke saath.**\n\n**Setup (10 min):**\n1. **Telegram bot** — @BotFather → /newbot → token copy. n8n mein Telegram credential banao. 📩 Trigger + 📤 Reply dono nodes pe lagao.\n2. **AI** — ⚙️ CONFIG mein `ai_base_url`:\n   - Ollama (FREE, local): `http://localhost:11434/v1` — pehle `ollama pull llama3.1` karo\n   - OpenAI: `https://api.openai.com/v1` + `ai_api_key` mein key\n3. **Memory sheet** — Google Sheet banao, tab `memory`, columns: `chat_id | role | content | ts`. Sheet ID CONFIG mein `sheet_id`.\n4. **Google credential** — 📚 Read Memory + 💾 Save Memory nodes pe lagao.\n5. Workflow **Active** karo → bot ko Telegram pe message bhejo.\n\n**Flow:** Trigger → CONFIG → Sheets se history → AI (history + naya msg) → jawab → history save.\n**Pro tip:** `system_prompt` badlo = nayi personality. Roman Urdu bot chahiye? Prompt mein likho: \"Reply in Roman Urdu.\"\n**Limit:** heavy traffic pe Sheets slow ho sakti hai — upgrade path README mein.\n",
    "height": 760,
    "width": 620
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "6511066a-26cc-421b-9bde-90a9bee01520",
   "name": "📩 Telegram Trigger",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    240,
    560
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "updates": [
     "message"
    ],
    "additionalFields": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "a2bb2af7-bad4-47a9-aa23-6b71244aee0f",
   "name": "⚙️ CONFIG",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
   "typeVersion": 3.4,
   "position": [
    460,
